# Implementation Plan - Dynamic Live Route Mapping, Redis Cache, Map Snapping & Log Routing

This plan outlines the changes to resolve:
1. Live route name mismatch using Redis Cache lookup (`Bus Number -> Active Trip -> Live Route`).
2. Log forwarding to the Admin UI `⚙️ Engine` tab without console lag.
3. Map snapping using Turf.js to align raw GPS points to highway routes.
4. Keeping Scraper logs quiet in the console terminal but running in the background.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Redis Connection Fail-Safe**: We will implement a wrapper that connects to your local Redis client (`redis://localhost:6379`). If Redis is not running or fails to connect, the system will seamlessly fall back to a high-performance in-memory Map cache. This prevents any crashes if Redis isn't started yet.
> - **Turf.js Snapping**: RAW coordinates from the Margdarshi feed will be snapped to the sequence of stops for the active route, ensuring buses stick exactly to the road on the map.

